  "title": "Pork in Peanut Sauce",
  "description": "A quick, easy, delicious pork with peanut sauce! Pork is marinated in a sauce of ginger, garlic, red pepper flakes, soy sauce, chicken broth, and peanut butter, then simmered with stir-fried onions, cashews, and vegetables. Serve over a bed of chopped romaine or noodles.",
